          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"contact.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <meta name=\\\"description\\\" content=\\\"Connect with {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} for gentle aromatherapy sessions, blends, and events. Safety-forward guidance and thoughtful care.\\\">\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg:#f7fbfa; --card:#ffffff; --muted:#6b7280; --accent-start:#a7f3d0; --accent-end:#c7b8ff; --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);\\n      --maxw:1100px; --radius:14px; --shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(12,18,31,0.06);\\n      font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial;\\n      color-scheme: light;\\n    }\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#ffffff 60%);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}\\n    a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:36px auto;padding:28px;display:grid;gap:28px}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}\\n    .logo{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent-start),var(--accent-end));box-shadow:0 6px 22px rgba(99,102,241,0.12);font-weight:700;color:#062330}\\n    nav{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}\\n    nav a{padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n    nav a.primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent-start),var(--accent-end));color:#04111a;font-weight:600}\\n\\n    .hero{position:relative;border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;padding:36px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(163,196,255,0.06), rgba(199,184,255,0.03));box-shadow:var(--shadow);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:26px}\\n    .hero h1{margin:0;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#042f30}\\n    .hero p{margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .card{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(3,7,18,0.04)}\\n\\n    form .row{display:flex;gap:10px}\\n    label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:#06424a;margin-bottom:6px}\\n    input[type=\\\"text\\\"],input[type=\\\"email\\\"],select,textarea{width:100%;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #e6eef0;background:transparent;font-size:14px}\\n    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}\\n    .muted{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    button.cta{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;border:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent-end),var(--accent-start));box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(163,196,255,0.12);font-weight:700;color:#04111a}\\n\\n    .info-grid{display:grid;gap:12px}\\n    .meta{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .meta svg{width:36px;height:36px;flex:0 0 36px}\\n\\n    .safety{margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:#334155;background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent,rgba(2,6,23,0.02));padding:14px;border-radius:10px}\\n\\n    footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:18px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n\\n    /* decorative pattern */\\n    .pattern{position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:0.18}\\n    .map{height:140px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0fbf8,#fbf6ff);display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--muted)}\\n\\n    @media (max-width:880px){\\n      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;align-items:start}\\n      nav{display:none}\\n      .wrap{margin:20px;padding:18px}\\n    }\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">A</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav aria-label=\\\"Main navigation\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Offerings</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"blends.html\\\">Blends</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"shop.html\\\">Store</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\" class=\\\"primary\\\">Rates</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main>\\n      <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"pattern\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 800 400\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" role=\\\"img\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n          <defs>\\n            <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#a7f3d0\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.18\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#c7b8ff\\\" stop-opacity=\\\"0.18\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n            <filter id=\\\"f1\\\" x=\\\"-20%\\\" y=\\\"-20%\\\" width=\\\"140%\\\" height=\\\"140%\\\"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\\\"44\\\" /></filter>\\n          </defs>\\n          <rect width=\\\"800\\\" height=\\\"400\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\"/>\\n          <g filter=\\\"url(#f1)\\\" fill=\\\"#a7f3d0\\\" opacity=\\\"0.28\\\">\\n            <circle cx=\\\"160\\\" cy=\\\"90\\\" r=\\\"80\\\"/>\\n            <circle cx=\\\"640\\\" cy=\\\"300\\\" r=\\\"120\\\"/>\\n          </g>\\n        </svg>\\n\\n        <div>\\n          <h1>Let's make time for what calms you.</h1>\\n          <p>Reach out to schedule a session, ask about blends, or reserve a spot in an upcoming series. Conversations begin with curiosity and care.</p>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\">\\n            <form id=\\\"contactForm\\\" method=\\\"post\\\" action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">\\n              <div class=\\\"row\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom:12px\\\">\\n                <div style=\\\"flex:1\\\">\\n                  <label for=\\\"name\\\">Your name</label>\\n                  <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" required placeholder=\\\"Jane Doe\\\">\\n                </div>\\n                <div style=\\\"width:170px\\\">\\n                  <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone</label>\\n                  <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{PHONE}}\\\">\\n                </div>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div style=\\\"margin-bottom:12px\\\">\\n                <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n                <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" required placeholder=\\\"you@domain.com\\\">\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div style=\\\"margin-bottom:12px\\\">\\n                <label for=\\\"location\\\">Location</label>\\n                <input id=\\\"location\\\" name=\\\"location\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}\\\">\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div style=\\\"margin-bottom:12px\\\">\\n                <label for=\\\"interest\\\">What would you like?</label>\\n                <select id=\\\"interest\\\" name=\\\"interest\\\">\\n                  <option>One-on-one session</option>\\n                  <option>Group series / events</option>\\n                  <option>Custom blend consultation</option>\\n                  <option>Wholesale / retail inquiry</option>\\n                </select>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div style=\\\"margin-bottom:12px\\\">\\n                <label for=\\\"message\\\">Message</label>\\n                <textarea id=\\\"message\\\" name=\\\"message\\\" placeholder=\\\"Share a little about what you're seeking...\\\"></textarea>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px\\\">\\n                <input id=\\\"consent\\\" type=\\\"checkbox\\\" name=\\\"consent\\\" required>\\n                <label for=\\\"consent\\\" class=\\\"muted\\\">I consent to {{BUSINESS_NAME}} contacting me about my request. I understand aromatherapy is not a substitute for medical care.</label>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n                <button class=\\\"cta\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>\\n                <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Prefer booking? <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Reserve a time</a></div>\\n              </div>\\n            </form>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <aside style=\\\"align-self:start\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n            <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px\\\">Contact</div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}</div>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:6px\\\">Phone: <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">{{PHONE}}</a></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Email: <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:14px\\\" class=\\\"meta\\\">\\n              <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\"><path d=\\\"M12 2a7 7 0 00-7 7c0 5.25 7 13 7 13s7-7.75 7-13a7 7 0 00-7-7z\\\" stroke=\\\"#375a57\\\" stroke-width=\\\"1.2\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\"/></svg>\\n              <div>\\n                <div style=\\\"font-weight:600\\\">Studio</div>\\n                <div class=\\\"muted\\\">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div class=\\\"safety\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"false\\\">\\n              <strong style=\\\"display:block;margin-bottom:6px\\\">Safety first</strong>\\n              <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Aromatherapy complements wellbeing practices. It is not medical treatment. Please inform me of allergies, pregnancy, or sensitivities before a session.</div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n              <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px\\\">Quick map</div>\\n              <div class=\\\"map\\\">Map placeholder</div>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </aside>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section style=\\\"display:grid;gap:16px;margin-top:18px\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">Notes on safety & guidance</h3>\\n          <div class=\\\"muted\\\">\\n            <p><strong>Patch test & dilution:</strong> Always dilute essential oils according to guidance. For topical use, a patch test is recommended: apply diluted oil to a small area and wait 24 hours for sensitivity.</p>\\n            <p><strong>Pregnancy & medical:</strong> If pregnant, nursing, or under medical care, consult a licensed provider before using essential oils. Sessions avoid contraindicated oils and prioritize safety.</p>\\n            <p><strong>Pets:</strong> Many oils affect animals differently. Notify me about household pets; we'll choose pet-safe approaches for shared spaces.</p>\\n            <p><strong>Allergies & sensitivities:</strong> Tell me about fragrance allergies or chemical sensitivities. I will adapt blends and delivery methods accordingly.</p>\\n            <p style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\"><em>These notes are guidance and do not replace professional medical advice.</em></p>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center\\\">\\n          <div>\\n            <strong>Prefer a call?</strong>\\n            <div class=\\\"muted\\\">Schedule a brief phone consult to discover the right approach for your needs.</div>\\n          </div>\\n          <div style=\\\"text-align:right\\\">\\n            <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\">Call {{PHONE}}</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      </section>\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>© <span id=\\\"year\\\"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — another quiet practice by {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a> · <a href=\\\"privacy.html\\\">Privacy</a> · <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <script>\\n    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();\\n    // Minimal client-side handling: prevent spammy submissions from missing consent\\n    document.getElementById('contactForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e){\\n      var c = document.getElementById('consent');\\n      if(!c.checked){\\n        e.preventDefault();\\n        alert('Please confirm consent to be contacted.');\\n      }\\n    });\\n  </script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"README.md\",\"content\":\"Contact page and notes for {{BUSINESS_NAME}} site\\n\\nThis bundle chunk contains two files:\\n\\n- contact.html — a responsive, accessibility-minded contact page tailored for an aromatherapy practitioner. It uses a calm gradient, subtle SVG pattern, and a safety-first message set. The form posts to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} and includes consent fields and prompts about allergies, pregnancy, and pets.\\n\\n- README.md — this file.\\n\\nDesign & structure highlights:\\n- Layout: zen_minimal with airy spacing, softened corners, and a two-column hero that collapses on narrow screens.\\n- Voice: minimal_poetic — concise, gentle, safety-forward language.\\n- Navigation: labels varied to keep site copy fresh across pages (Home, Offerings, Blends, Store, Rates).\\n- Safety copy: patch testing, dilution, pregnancy, and pets guidance included in the contact page; explicit legal note that aromatherapy is not medical care.\\n- Visuals: decorative SVG pattern is embedded inline for immediate rendering. The site expects a unique decorative asset at assets/img/pattern.svg to be included elsewhere in the full bundle for reuse.\\n\\nPlaceholders to replace:\\n- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}\\n- {{TAGLINE}}\\n- {{PHONE}}\\n- {{EMAIL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}\\n- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\n- {{CITY}}\\n- {{STATE}}\\n- {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}\\n- {{FAVORITE_BLEND}} (not used on this page but present site-wide)\\n\\nAccessibility notes:\\n- Form fields have labels.\\n- Color contrast kept high for text; decorative graphics are aria-hidden where appropriate.\\n\\nIntegration:\\n- Form posts to {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}; if using a serverless endpoint or third-party form provider, set that URL accordingly.\\n- Ensure the assets/img/pattern.svg provided in another chunk is present for consistent branding across pages.\\n\\nLegal & safety:\\n- The page intentionally avoids clinical or medical claims. Replacements should preserve safety-first wording.\\n\\nIf you need an alternate tone or a shorter contact card for a popup/modal, request a variant and note the desired length and voice.\"}\nBUNDLE_END"
